-- Service NPCs beside every non-capital innkeeper.
--
-- Pairs with the AreaTable change that made those same town sub-areas
-- sanctuaries: a town you cannot be attacked in is where a bank and an
-- auction house belong. Capitals are deliberately excluded - they already
-- have all of this.
--
-- Positions come from each innkeeper's own spawn, on a small ring around it,
-- so no coordinate here was guessed. Re-runnable: the guid block is cleared
-- first.

DELETE FROM creature WHERE guid BETWEEN 214000 AND 214999;

